Spec: Private secure stream SDK

Purpose:
  Give independent applications a normal duplex stream after authenticated, authorized Agent attachment.

Owns:
  ./BusinessConnections.cs

References:
  /contracts/dotnet/LinkGate.Control/BusinessStream.sdd

Must:
  Pin the data-pipe server to the same trusted Agent before sending any attachment bytes.
  Keep application-saved mutation IDs and report unknown opens without retrying or replaying payload.
  Preserve fixed authenticated resource-exhausted connection results as well as authorization failures.
  Preserve logical HTTP authority and TLS validation in application adapters.
  Offer explicit experimental relay open only after negotiating secure.stream.relay; validate direct/relay result labels and preserve method-specific operation identity without automatic fallback.

Tasks:
  [x] #1 Verify independent SDK-only HTTPS, WebSocket and TCP half-close through actual private data attachments.
